      "created_at": "2015-03-28T05:54:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey guys,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So this year, my boyfriend and I are finally going to be cosplaying! We've wanted to for a couple years now but never found the time to do it.</p><p>Here are the characters we'll (hopefully) be cosplaying as:</p><p><a href=\"http://www.the-arcade.ie/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/x-men-animated-series-season-1-1-night-of-sentinels-cartoon-jubilee-sentinel-mall.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Jubilee</a></p><p><a href=\"http://img4.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20130723205226/avengersalliance/images/a/ac/Uncanny_Cyclops_Portrait_Art.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Cyclops</a></p><p><a href=\"http://img3.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20140804181131/leagueoflegends/images/4/44/Jayce_Debonair_concept.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Jayce</a> (genderbender)</p><p><a href=\"http://www.newsoflegends.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/Debonair-Vi.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Vi</a> (genderbender)</p><p><a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/wFy8Cyv.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Setback</a></p><p><a href=\"http://sotm.wdfiles.com/local--files/heroes:expatriette/extac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Expatriette</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We've already got some ideas for the xmen and league of legends characters' wardrobe (trying not to buy too many clothes, although I did find a yellow trenchcoat and some oxford shoes).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Was wondering if you guys have any tips or ideas that could help us! Especially with constructing the league of legends weapons =P</p>",
