      "cooked": "<p>My knowledge of League of Legends is basically \"I've heard of it, and I think it's some kind of PvP game and therefore I'm not interested\", but it's always interesting to see what people's Sentinels costumes look like, seeing as I'm actually familiar with those characters (well okay, I used to watch the X-Men cartoon when I was a kid and I've seen the first two films but that's about the extent of my knowledge there as well) :D.</p>",
