      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-30T17:19:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The majority of my knowledge of League of Legends is \"Man, those guys were so loud, almost every volunteer in the PAX Australia GTG booth lost their voice\"</p><p>As far as props go, many people use foam or hardened paper, so as to keep them light (you don't want to be carrying something heavy around all con)</p><p>Also,&nbsp;http://cosplaying-on-a-budget.tumblr.com/ is where a lot of people submit instructions on how to make various costumes and props.</p>",
