      "created_at": "2015-04-08T12:50:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"itsshortstuff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/c0e974/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> itsshortstuff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>haven't started on the costumes due to not having access to a sewing machine… we should work on that…BUTwe have started on weapon designs. here's where I'm at with Expat's Pride and Prejudice! (plus the subsequent mess =P)&nbsp;<a href=\"http://s3.photobucket.com/user/lilasia222/media/11062315_10204504540074292_7820839985927854557_n.jpg.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f4086c3679e9de8eeb89059690e5127459ca9b40.png\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"yOOxZSdPo31FQoMZGuQTxD3Wtva\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"160\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"http://s3.photobucket.com/user/lilasia222/media/603867_10204504540474302_7342288812688472503_n.jpg.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f4086c3679e9de8eeb89059690e5127459ca9b40.png\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"yOOxZSdPo31FQoMZGuQTxD3Wtva\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"160\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's exciting! I just watched a video the other day about how you could turn those into aluminum casts with a bucket of sand and a crucible.</p>",
